-uid=\"195910\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/win8en\">win8en</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:26:32 +08:00\">14h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>今天瞬间感觉贵了，可能还是之前太便宜了！哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981491\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8627/ca70/274063_normal.png?m=1781581742\" alt=\"shintendo\" data-uid=\"274063\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shintendo\">shintendo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:51:42 +08:00\">14h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/loading\">loading</a> <br>“目前没有不代表以后没有”也是牛逼，按这逻辑可以用任何理由抨击任何人<br>人家是 MIT 的，价格有第三方兜底，可不像 OA 两个大爹可以随意收割</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982107\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b989/ed4a/91590_normal.png?m=1776430252\" alt=\"fang2hou\" data-uid=\"91590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fang2hou\">fang2hou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:00:41 +08:00\">12h 6m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国外也就私人用用官方 API ，但凡有点信息安全要求的基本都要求提供商是 in region 。<br>这波 DS 提价我觉得是好事，反正模型已经开源，市面上有这么多提供商都能用。提价既能